[{"title":"发油田","author":"李云龙","text":"猿声远近应，出户尽烟峦。\n地僻日光薄，林交山气寒。\n芋田数亩在，茅屋几家残。\n独有罗山色，遥从雪里看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42061,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪竹","author":"李云龙","text":"清溪望不极，烟水绕长林。\n已过芦花港，还经杨柳阴。\n鸟啼沙树暝，猿啸海云沉。\n借问采菱女，前村几许深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42062,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上作","author":"李云龙","text":"春水漾微涟，桃花开两边。\n唱歌出浣女，吹笛钓鱼船。\n鸟掠前村雨，猿啼岛树烟。\n云山遥在望，客思坐悠然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42063,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠伯燮陈子","author":"李云龙","text":"湖海称豪士，君家喜再看。\n常悬苍玉佩，新着碧云冠。\n渥水来神骏，青霄振彩鸾。\n何须耀裘马，知是谢庭兰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42064,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过黄逢一","author":"李云龙","text":"秋尽菊犹芳，主人开草堂。\n我来云日暮，霜压薜萝墙。\n小设花间席，频飞竹下觞。\n醉来疏礼法，当恕阮生狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42065,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠良公","author":"李云龙","text":"背囊行卖药，来往在人群。\n灌顶有甘露，慈心如大云。\n杏花妆宝树，药椀贮经文。\n已證医王法，自他谁任分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42066,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水西别业新成","author":"李云龙","text":"结庐依薜荔，一径入桑麻。\n庭院无多处，林塘自一家。\n云深时护竹，水气晚蒸花。\n已择芦林待，秋风理钓槎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42067,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居","author":"李云龙","text":"东林初日上，竹里紫荆开。\n摘果鸟飞去，折花蜂逐来。\n閒云留作幔，承露取当杯。\n醉托游仙梦，流莺唤不回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42068,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春偕唐美卿游桃花坞","author":"李云龙","text":"河柳叶已大，黄鹂声渐高。\n望花寻古道，倚树听春涛。\n落锦随归棹，明霞覆钓舠。\n还携阮郎去，洞里觅仙曹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42069,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书怀","author":"李云龙","text":"三江鼓棹前，五岳杖藜边。\n何苦投尘网，频年负胜缘。\n忘机惟鹿豕，适意是林泉。\n不见浮丘伯，乘鸾向紫烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42070,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送客游秣陵","author":"李云龙","text":"秣陵佳丽地，自古擅豪华。\n今日乌衣巷，已无王谢家。\n钟山当殿落，淮水绕城斜。\n君到秋江上，菰芦正着花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42071,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬罗集虚","author":"李云龙","text":"我家寒塘曲，秋水方潺湲。\n枫叶映窗户，芦花隐钓船。\n观鱼坐磐石，洗药向清泉。\n何以遗君子，芙蓉正可搴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42072,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀王元卿","author":"李云龙","text":"江干黄叶落，玉露晓犹飞。\n遥想吴门外，鲈鱼秋正肥。\n风尘书不达，云树意相依。\n借问南飞雁，今年归未归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42073,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬黎孺旬","author":"李云龙","text":"黄鹂鸣已急，柳絮落纷纷。\n竹屋飘寒雨，绳床冷白云。\n夜虫违伏枕，芳草怨离群。\n独有梧桐月，清光如待君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42074,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀仙诗寄唐美卿于三山","author":"李云龙","text":"曾随鹤驭去，云外挟飞仙。\n玉袂一为别，金镳遂杳然。\n青鸾书不达，弱水棹难前。\n空结游仙梦，三山何处边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42075,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"僧林","author":"李云龙","text":"梵宇幽寻处，僧林日暮时。\n寒泉过石急，清磬出花迟。\n问竹猿先觉，穿松鹤自随。\n白云莫飞去，长共尔为期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42076,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送梁无畸","author":"李云龙","text":"士当微贱日，谁不愿知名。\n及自都通显，何曾有令声。\n浮沉非尔意，穷达见人情。\n慎惜前途辙，毋令负平生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42077,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答黎美璋","author":"李云龙","text":"竹窗窗外月，流影入帷寒。\n尚忆清秋夜，同君倚槛看。\n相思劳梦寐，遥望隔林峦。\n伫立闻飞鸟，因声报羽翰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42078,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同黄元卿张约之梁日良游月溪留宿","author":"李云龙","text":"天寒山狖叫，石涧水淙淙。\n野径入秋草，柴门临古松。\n林行惊宿鸟，云卧对诸峰。\n明日寻仙去，同鞭白玉龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42079,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀朱季美","author":"李云龙","text":"忆尔离家日，萧条雁鹜天。\n风尘闽海道，烟雨楚江船。\n别路馀千里，归期尚隔年。\n巢云堂上月，春到为谁圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42080,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归雁","author":"李云龙","text":"汀洲春草绿，沙雁起双双。\n细柳怀边塞，青枫望楚江。\n羁人忆北极，幽客倚南窗。\n少妇缄书在，何时到受降。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42081,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居 其一","author":"李云龙","text":"朝来片雨过，几树带清晖。\n偶与山翁出，閒看水鹤飞。\n苔生采药路，水没钓鱼矶。\n隔岸闻人语，前溪罢网归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42082,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居 其二","author":"李云龙","text":"山暝见归鸦，陂塘急暮蛙。\n雨肥卢橘子，风落荔支花。\n野食分樵爨，清歌过钓槎。\n閒随渔父去，溪上醉流霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42083,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居 其三","author":"李云龙","text":"东风动幽兴，杖策出柴门。\n偶值烟霞叟，相邀农圃言。\n新荷浮后沼，脩竹荫前园。\n早晚荔枝熟，还来醉瓦盘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42084,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"解嘲 其一","author":"李云龙","text":"天地思自奋，岂不畏搉残。\n与我周旋久，随时俯仰难。\n青山将毋隐，白眼向人看。\n卿自用卿法，寒松本耐寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42085,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"解嘲 其二","author":"李云龙","text":"放逐前贤事，飘零勿复言。\n葵虽能卫足，兰本忌当门。\n落日掩蓬户，秋风卧竹园。\n山妻笑相视，今日舌犹存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42086,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠袁尔昌","author":"李云龙","text":"我有龙泉剑，三年置匣中。\n未曾试锋刃，无与辨雌雄。\n子抱四方志，人称烈士风。\n今朝脱相赠，风雨吼晴空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42087,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"波罗庙","author":"李云龙","text":"古庙沧江上，平沙一径穿。\n幢幡会真馆，箫鼓进香船。\n绿树浮佳气，青峰绕瑞烟。\n回看荡舟处，千里水云连。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42088,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北山绝顶","author":"李云龙","text":"秋山閒引望，但觉与云齐。\n及到高峰上，方知众壑低。\n松间下笙鹤，云里听天鸡。\n因忆从前路，烟霞几处迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42089,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠汪伯耳 其一","author":"李云龙","text":"少年奋长剑，跃马向边州。\n射猎阴山下，追胡瀚海头。\n自言负远略，唾手取封侯。\n宁知时不遇，流落向炎陬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42090,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠汪伯耳 其二","author":"李云龙","text":"去国八千里，离家十六年。\n身馀片舌在，诗有万人传。\n啸咏能终日，升沉莫问天。\n独怜行乐处，不在五湖船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42091,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮雨","author":"李云龙","text":"东风吹暮雨，萧飒动江城。\n一夜池流急，满庭春草生。\n乱丝摇竹影，飞瀑带书声。\n独有怀人处，应伤离别情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42092,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江亭晓望怀幼良罗子","author":"李云龙","text":"一上江亭望，微茫水国分。\n残潮荡晓月，村火照春云。\n浦溆凝龙气，沙洲起雁群。\n归帆遥莫辨，心折为思君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42093,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过王元卿山居","author":"李云龙","text":"昨入林峦去，初怜磴道赊。\n主人开竹牖，留客饭松花。\n野径草争发，山厨云半遮。\n坐看长夏晚，山郭起秋霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42094,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上巳东山社集","author":"李云龙","text":"竹里啭黄鹂，花间卧鹿麋。\n过桥携鹤去，坐石看云移。\n山醉浮杯斝，池流清梦思。\n毋辞一韨濯，歌唱答芳时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42095,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茅堂","author":"李云龙","text":"茅堂占西岭，门对乱峰开。\n时有岩花落，香从樵路来。\n松阴宜散帙，山月每当杯。\n十载风尘客，劳劳梦乍回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42096,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独坐","author":"李云龙","text":"独坐翠微中，遥遥闻暮钟。\n此时洞口月，正照溪边松。\n鹤唳答清啸，花蹊持短筇。\n终当谢尘鞅，买断云边峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42097,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨过","author":"李云龙","text":"门前凉雨过，洗出数峰新。\n散步溪桥上，松风来袭人。\n山童扫落叶，野老荐芳蘋。\n不信幽源里，桃花别有津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42098,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山厨","author":"李云龙","text":"山厨新烟火，帘日淡无晖。\n曳屣衡门下，临风歌采薇。\n原宪贫非病，袁安卧不违。\n谁能共妻子，相对泣牛衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42099,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"紫竹洞","author":"李云龙","text":"灵岩跨石桥，无竹亦萧萧。\n特借洛伽胜，还为水月标。\n花将梵宇掩，云共磬声飘。\n虽自非南海，心空闻海潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42100,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚晴","author":"李云龙","text":"宿雨尚含滋，松梢月上时。\n寒泉过石急，清磬出花迟。\n野竹抽新笋，归禽觅故枝。\n明朝采兰杜，忆与美人期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42101,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄元卿","author":"李云龙","text":"野径竹交加，山厨云半遮。\n主人开草阁，留客饭松花。\n榻静鸟窥帙，檐喧蜂放衙。\n鹿门妻子在，应许共移家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42102,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李嗣良","author":"李云龙","text":"海内推狂客，风流又四明。\n雄心穷不挫，白眼醉尝横。\n时自仰天笑，伊谁解此情。\n何当向秋暮，黯黯别愁生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42103,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈来献","author":"李云龙","text":"东风门巷寂，杨柳数株斜。\n一夜闻寒雨，开帘见落花。\n感时念离索，之子卧烟霞。\n愿托青松树，山中阅岁华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42104,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀罗季作","author":"李云龙","text":"东风吹淑气，一夜动江关。\n芳草共愁长，流莺唤梦还。\n美人在天末，相望隔春山。\n日暮长堤上，垂杨徒自扳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42105,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟过安远喜钟彦辅徐慈明李伯脩出送","author":"李云龙","text":"两乡虽接壤，一水恨盈盈。\n何必今朝别，方为万里程。\n路难君莫问，酒尽我当行。\n不用勤相送，天涯共此情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42106,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀刘思约","author":"李云龙","text":"旧游回首处，侠者忆刘生。\n锦瑟佳人倚，金罍上客倾。\n为人解纷难，不自爱身名。\n宝剑持相赠，知予远道情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42107,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入关留别袁大司马","author":"李云龙","text":"寒风生大漠，一夜堕关榆。\n绝塞胡鹰击，南枝粤鸟呼。\n短衣驱去马，长楫就归途。\n侯吏相逢笑，依然旧日繻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42108,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留别梁非馨","author":"李云龙","text":"江花频入梦，心在岭云端。\n但忆归去好，要知行路难。\n长缨君合请，短剑我羞看。\n砍向醉中别，天寒酒已阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42109,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上同邝公路家定夫作","author":"李云龙","text":"画桥栖息处，绕屋尽烟林。\n向夕山雨歇，出门湖水深。\n疏花含晚照，垂柳结春阴。\n箫鼓人归尽，遥闻啼暮禽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42110,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送安仲","author":"李云龙","text":"猿啼洞庭树，人在木兰舟。\n抚卷爱斯语，临风怀胜游。\n君浮湘水棹，言断楚江秋。\n昔日依刘客，江边尚有楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42111,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿韩寅仲","author":"李云龙","text":"一士不得意，归来今白头。\n人疑旧仙吏，地是古丹丘。\n晚饭进珠黍，新诗题石楼。\n不须求大药，君已擅千秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42112,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴子远次韵","author":"李云龙","text":"悠悠山水调，千古托知心。\n以我意中事，发君膝上琴。\n涉江采兰沚，分手隔枫林。\n别鹤毋劳怨，前期幸可寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42113,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同阮集之泛舟游三山遇杜退思上公车过访","author":"李云龙","text":"三山待逋客，双桨泛平川。\n何意莺花伴，来寻虾菜船。\n飘萍虽暂合，惊雁不成联。\n明发燕吴隔，枫林有梦悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42114,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日阮集之招同计无不璩山甫叶开美潘次鲁徐介白林六长方圣羽徐介夫集警园次韵","author":"李云龙","text":"高斋饶水石，长夏亦冰壶。\n一雨忽如沐，好风仍与俱。\n竹凉侵簟玉，荷响答歌珠。\n别有千秋缕，都誇五色殊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42115,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得高杨拂地垂","author":"李云龙","text":"千枝复万枝，濯濯卉春晖。\n踠地藏歌鸟，当筵斗舞衣。\n雨馀芳欲滴，风静翠成围。\n却忆柴桑老，门前舆醉归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42116,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漓江","author":"李云龙","text":"云气晚霏霏，高林送落晖。\n悠然江上水，遥望戍烟归。\n岸树如人立，江鱼作鸟飞。\n角声飘客梦，遥绕故园扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42117,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南野","author":"李云龙","text":"索居南野上，左右带林峦。\n九月风霜起，孤斋日夜寒。\n挥弦鸿在目，挹露菊堪餐。\n独有蒹葭水，伊人欲见难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42118,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗季作饯别","author":"李云龙","text":"春城花满林，绮席敝花阴。\n不践古人意，其如远客心。\n归鸿催去棹，别鹤怨瑶琴。\n明发江河路，江湖信几深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42119,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题徐氏园","author":"李云龙","text":"君家好园馆，当户众山陈。\n问树因知世，有云难赠人。\n一星还着膝，三凤日相亲。\n不是归心切，千金愿买邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42120,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黎孺旬之官闽中","author":"李云龙","text":"如何左迁去，捧檄尚为欢。\n知子有老母，不遑卑小官。\n风尘闽海远，雨雪大江寒。\n一叶萧条甚，堪嗟廉吏难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42121,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闰八月十四夕待月钟氏映日池馆遇雨","author":"李云龙","text":"孤斋池水上，待月拟南楼。\n不谓今宵雨，翻多一度秋。\n湿衣寒不见，盈手赠难投。\n来夕还相望，清光为倍酬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42122,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访袁道生新居","author":"李云龙","text":"去人今渐远，门巷对清溪。\n綦子已丧我，维摩自有妻。\n采芳时进艇，听鸟独扶藜。\n却忆杜子美，草堂瀼水西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42123,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬王子翼先","author":"李云龙","text":"十年不相见，相见感弥深。\n借问千秋事，依然一片心。\n清溪邀步履，流水入鸣琴。\n何用展言宴，瑶华有好音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42124,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端阳赠陈伯燮新婚","author":"李云龙","text":"凉雨晓初歇，江天云作峰。\n闻君理兰枻，涉水采芙蓉。\n蒲叶带罗碧，榴花裙茜浓。\n今年竞渡早，应为客乘龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42125,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏朋泉 其一","author":"李云龙","text":"石窦忽涓涓，双垂是乳泉。\n溪回行若逊，坎习势尝联。\n过雨闻声应，蒸云得气先。\n愿将流水引，还为佐虞弦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42126,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏朋泉 其二","author":"李云龙","text":"滋兰九畹润，洗药一泓深。\n雨泽此相丽，幽源许共寻。\n吹风飘古雪，激石响空林。\n恬淡长如此，因知君子心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42127,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"严子陵祠","author":"李云龙","text":"咄咄徒相讶，冥鸿已早知。\n欲臣老子耳，安用故人为。\n处士千秋气，桐江一钓丝。\n翻嫌渭滨叟，偏与后车期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42128,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泛舟桃花溪同刘萧郎","author":"李云龙","text":"黄鸟呼人去，扁舟共采芳。\n沿溪信孤棹，隔水见红妆。\n映日霞千片，吹风锦一行。\n天台诸女伴，持此媚刘郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42129,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送汪子","author":"李云龙","text":"生平一片气，慷慨此谋身。\n万里寻知己，长安无主人。\n悲歌发易水，长啸入西秦。\n笑彼悠悠者，知非心所亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42130,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"不是庵","author":"李云龙","text":"是庵即不是，亦不是非庵。\n北垞转更北，南塘还复南。\n閒乘一叶去，如泛百花潭。\n烟水无多处，何劳五十三。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":42131,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]